{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98396","id":2137046106,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc5_YLxa","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98396","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98396.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98396.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98396","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98396/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98396/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98396/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4bb041de8b6fa0b1bea889405fac773de0ce1bf9","number":98396,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix issue with incomplete property overrides in C# sourcegen","user":{"login":"paulloz","id":437025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzAyNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/437025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz","html_url":"https://github.com/paulloz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR fixes a crash in several generators, preventing compilation through CS8785.\r\n\r\nTo filter read-only properties, we currently check if the property is read-only (duh), or is its set method is init-only. In reality, we cannot take for granted the fact a set method is available to check, even when the property is not read-only. This is because C# allows the following.\r\n\r\n```cs\r\nclass Foo\r\n{\r\n    // Define a readable, and writable property as virtual\r\n    public virtual string MyString\r\n    {\r\n        get;\r\n        set;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nclass Bar : Foo\r\n{\r\n    // Only override the get accessor\r\n    public override string MyString\r\n    {\r\n        get { return \"Gotcha\"; }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nSince we assume we have a set method to check, we're raising an NRE when checking for the init-only flag. To fix this, we're now recursing on the overridden property if it makes sense.\r\n\r\nCheers :v:\r\n\r\n- _Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/71102_","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_u